        "66": `Using product-difference identities and index shifts one finds the three provided expressions are equal (\\(u=v=w\\)).`,
        "67": `Central difference identities: verify by series expansion using \\(\\delta\\) and \\(\\mu\\).`,
        "68": `For \\(\\Delta^2 a^{4x}\\) with \\(h=1\\), factor \\((a^4 - 1)^2 a^{4x}\\).`,
        "69": `\\(\\Delta(1/x)\\) at \\(x=1\\) with \\(h=1\\) equals \\(1/2 - 1 = -1/2\\).`,
        "70": `Use the identities for forward differences and exponentials to derive the requested equality.`
